[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/dag_engine_lite/pretense/dag_engine_lite_impl_pretense.py: Add twelve contract-coverage tests (fake + real suites) for previously unasserted behaviors: removing a node with both prerequisites and dependents clears every incident edge; removing a node after scheduler synchronization reports only currently registered nodes; get_state initializes READY/PENDING before any other scheduler transition; mark_succeeded promotes only PENDING dependents while leaving terminal ones untouched; SKIP_DOWNSTREAM over a diamond graph marks every transitive dependent SKIPPED exactly once; and CONTINUE_ON_ERROR leaves a blocked dependent PENDING and unexecuted when wave execution halts.
